{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "description": "before and after: RFC 3339 strings or epoch-millisecond numbers, compared as integer milliseconds (fractions truncated, numbers floored), strictly. 2026-01-01T00:00:00Z is 1767225600000. Each flag serves on from a rule on attr and falls through to off.",
  "ruleset": {
